Firmware for the heaviest combination of the simulator: temperature sensing, remote loads, RF
data logging and relays in one build. The two local loads (D5, D6), two remote loads (nodes 15 and
16), RF data logging to the gateway, two relays on D8 and D9 (as configs/relays.patch: 1000 and
2000 W of surplus, 200 W of import, 1 minute minimum ON and OFF, 1-minute filter), the override pin
D4 and the two DS18B20 on D3. The RFM69 takes D2 and D10-D13, so the relay patch's diversion,
router OFF, rotation and dual tariff pins (D3, D2, D12, D11) have no pin left: not in this build.

  PVR_SIM_BUILD=1 sh sim/configs/sim_config.sh
  git apply --unidiff-zero sim/configs/temp_rf_relays.patch
  PLATFORMIO_BUILD_DIR=.pio/build-combo pio run --project-dir Mk2_3phase_RFdatalog_temp -e basic
  git checkout Mk2_3phase_RFdatalog_temp/config.h

